    "detailed_description": "Ro-Sham-Boom is a 2-Player, Rock, Paper, Scissors game where you and a friend can duke it out to be the best RPS player! There are several signs to throw out at your opponent, each with their own strengths and weaknesses. You have up to 3 Shields per match to protect yourself from damage and TNT that does a flat amount of damage to your opponent but does a bit of damage to yourself too. Let this game be the decider instead of using the old fashioned and outdated game of Rock, Paper, Scissors. Are you ready for some Ro-Sham-Boom!?",
